#: ../../guide/configuration.md:49
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Both bool shorthand (`harper: true`) and nested config (`harper: { enabled: "
"true, dialect: \"British\" }`) are supported. Use the shorthand when you "
"only need to toggle an engine; use the nested form when you need engine-"
"specific settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/configuration.md:52
msgid ""
"**Harper** is built in and requires no external installation. "
"**LanguageTool**, **Vale**, and **Proselint** are external tools that must "
"be installed separately and available on your `$PATH`. See the dedicated "
"setup guides:"
msgstr ""

